# Core API Reference

## Canvas Setup

### createCanvas()

```javascript
// 2D (default renderer)
createCanvas(1920, 1080);

// WebGL (3D, shaders)
createCanvas(1920, 1080, WEBGL);

// Responsive
createCanvas(windowWidth, windowHeight);
```

